  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PWC GPE Rolling Audit</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PWC GPE Rolling Audit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna granskning utg&#xf6;r en del av &quot;Assurance Services&quot; i bifogat dokument &quot;TENDER EVALUATION REPORT OF 25 TITLES OF LEVELED STORY BOOKS&quot;, utarbetat av Tanzania Institute of Education (TIE) som underlag f&#xf6;r &quot;no-objection&quot; fr&#xe5;n ambassaden Tanzania i enlighet med uppdragsbeskrivningen f&#xf6;r PWC:
&#x2022; Granska och kommentera om relevanta statliga regleringar och f&#xf6;rfaranden f&#xf6;r upphandling har f&#xf6;ljts;
&#x2022; Kontrollera om kriterierna f&#xf6;r regeringen utv&#xe4;rdering kriterier har f&#xf6;ljts;
&#x2022; Kontrollera kapaciteten bland budgivande f&#xf6;retag att leverera tj&#xe4;nster;
&#x2022; Granska valuta f&#xf6;r pengarna aspekter av varor och tj&#xe4;nster som upphandlas, med fokus p&#xe5; priser och andra tillh&#xf6;rande kostnader som lagts fram av budgivningen f&#xf6;retag som anv&#xe4;nder tillg&#xe4;ngliga och relevanta riktm&#xe4;rken nationella och internationella pris; och
&#x2022; Kontrollera, i m&#xf6;jligaste m&#xe5;n, anskaffade varor och tj&#xe4;nster levereras och avslutade i enlighet med de n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga specifikationerna och tekniska standarder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">These audits shall be carried out  to perform Assurance Services on the document,&#x201d; TENDER EVALUATION REPORT OF 25 TITLES OF LEVELED STORY BOOKS&#x201d; prepared by the Tanzania Institute of Education (TIE) prior to the &#x201c;no objection&#x201d; from the Embassy of Sweden Tanzania by performing the procedures in the TORs for the assignment outlined below:
&#x2022;	Review and comment if relevant government regulations and procedures on procurement were followed diligently;
&#x2022;	Check if the Government bid evaluation criteria were correctly done and followed;
&#x2022;	Check the capacity of selected company in delivering the services requested by different ministries;
&#x2022;	Review value for money aspects of goods and services being procured, focusing on prices and other associated costs submitted by the bidding companies using available and relevant national and international price benchmarks; and 
&#x2022;	Verify, to the extent possible, whether procured goods and services are supplied and completed according to the required specifications and technical standards</narrative>
  </description>
